<SiteLayout
  title={"Goto Terminal Survey — Dan Vallentyne"}
  description={"Documenting the environment beneath the terminals"}
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <PageHeading title={"Goto Terminal Survey"} eyebrow={"Expeditions"} lead={"Documenting the environment beneath the terminals"}>
      <a slot="breadcrumb" class="breadcrumb" href="/expeditions/">← All expeditions</a>
    </PageHeading>
    <figure class="detail-hero ">
      <img src="/assets/goto-terminal.webp?v=20261005-104139" alt="Goto terminals, Terminal A, Bonaire · October 2026. Source: Goto project archive." width="1600" height="739" fetchpriority="high">
      <figcaption>Goto terminals, Terminal A, Bonaire · October 2026. Source: Goto project archive.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="article-layout article-single">
      <article class="prose">
        <p><strong>Location:</strong> Goto terminals, Bonaire.</p>
        <p><strong>Year:</strong> 2026.</p>
        <p><strong>Client:</strong> Rijkswaterstaat.</p>
        <p><strong>My role:</strong> underwater photogrammetry, imagery processing, inspection software, and technical reporting.</p>
        <p>I surveyed beneath Bonaire’s Goto terminals in 2026 to document marine debris and reef condition, producing maps, reconstructions, and inspection tools.</p>
        <h2>The field assignment</h2>
        <p>Photogrammetry supported reconstruction and mapping of the underwater environment.</p>
        <div class="article-gallery">
          <figure>
            <img src="/assets/goto-field-boat.webp" alt="A diver aboard the survey boat beside the Goto terminal" width="1600" height="739" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/goto-field-boat-480.webp 480w, /assets/images/goto-field-boat-960.webp 960w, /assets/goto-field-boat.webp 1600w" sizes="(max-width:700px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:864px) calc(100vw - 64px), 800px">
            <figcaption>Aboard the survey boat at Goto terminals · 5 October 2026.</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure>
            <img src="/assets/goto-terminal-detail.webp" alt="Goto terminal loading arms, walkway and mooring structure viewed from the water" width="1600" height="739" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/goto-terminal-detail-480.webp 480w, /assets/images/goto-terminal-detail-960.webp 960w, /assets/goto-terminal-detail.webp 1600w" sizes="(max-width:700px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:864px) calc(100vw - 64px), 800px">
            <figcaption>Terminal B viewed from the water.</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure>
            <video src="/assets/goto-terminal-structure.mp4" poster="/assets/goto-terminal-structure-poster.webp" width="1920" height="1080" controls playsinline preload="metadata" aria-label="A closer view of the Goto terminal structure filmed from the water">
              <a href="/assets/goto-terminal-structure.mp4">Watch the Goto terminal video</a></video>
            <figcaption>A closer view of the significant damage to Terminal B</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
        <h2>Survey outputs</h2>
        <p>I produced 3D reconstructions, orthomosaics, and technical reports documenting survey coverage and outputs.</p>
        <p>I built a viewer and labeling tool for Rijkswaterstaat to inspect imagery and analyze debris.</p>
        <h2>Explore the inspection tool</h2>
        <p><a href="../projects/goto-survey-viewer.html">Goto Survey Viewer</a>: explore the inspection and labeling tool.</p>
        <p><a href="index.html">All expeditions</a> · <a href="../contact.html">Discuss a project</a></p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
